      "date": "2026-03-30T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Halder Venture Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 62.499938 million in funding from P.K. BIO-LINK PRIVATE LIMITED",
      "body": "Halder Venture Limited announced a private placement of 793,650 convertible warrants at a price of INR 78.75 per warrant for gross proceeds of INR 62,499,937.50 on March 30, 2026. The warrants will be convertible into one common share of the company at INR 236.25 per share and will mature in 18 months from the date of the allotment. The securities will be issued on preferential basis. The transaction has been approved by the board of directors of the company. The transaction included participation from new investor P.K. BIO-LINK PRIVATE LIMITED.",
