      "date": "2026-02-16T08:13:09.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹16.71 (vs ₹17.10 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹16.71 (down from ₹17.10 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.63b (down 54% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹206.4m (down 3.0% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 13% (up from 6.0% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 41% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
